  "description": "Graduate the Academy by Luck is a trash VR game loved by no one—except for him. But that doesn’t mean he wanted to end up inside of it! After transmigrating into the body of a young female character named Oknodie, this protagonist will have to start from the bottom of a hierarchy based on luck. With only his wits and the help of a few new friends, will he be able to raise Oknodie up and win the game, or will he be trapped inside the body of a weakling character forever?!\n\n**Original Webtoon:**     \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/67991554), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EC%95%84%EC%B9%B4%EB%8D%B0%EB%AF%B8-%ED%9D%91%EB%A7%89%EC%9D%98-%EB%94%B8%EC%9D%B4-%EB%90%98%EC%97%88%EB%8B%A4/4682) \n\n**Official Translations:**   \n[Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/184958), [English](https://tapas.io/series/i-became-the-villains-daughter-at-the-academy/info)",
